{
  "about": [
    "The app grant rule, pinned across the two runtimes. Rust reads this file in talaria-users' unit tests",
    "(app_grant_views, app_views_of, resolve_view_grants, enabled_slugs_from, discovered_apps_in); TS reads it",
    "in ui/src/server/app-grants.fixture.test.ts (appGrantViews, appGrantViewsOf, appAccess, enabledSlugsFrom,",
    "listInstalledApps). The junction is `appGrants`: Rust must resolve each viewer's grants to that list, and",
    "TS must turn that list into `access`. Change the rule on both sides, then here."
